PARTIAL
- apps/job-service/src/infra/job-log/job-log-writer.impl.ts hand-writes retry loops with exponential backoff (run() round retry, store() batch retry, retryDelay() = min(base*2**n, max)); CLAUDE.md forbids hand-writing retries a library provides, and the project already chose p-retry for retries (DECISIONS.md "Calls from the worker to job-service ... p-retry", used in apps/job-execution-service/src/infra/execution/job-execution.impl.ts). Either move the writer's retries onto p-retry (infinite retries, abort signal for stop, lease check in the failure hook) or get the user's approval for a hand-written exception through AskUserQuestion and record it in decisions.md and DECISIONS.md
